{"id": 43791933, "slug": "bitcoin-is-not-money-lack-of-payments", "title": "Bitcoin Is Not Money  - Lack of payments (p2)", "subtitle": "June 21st, 2016", "post_date": "2021-11-09T19:14:43.954Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 771, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p><em>This is the second in our series of posts on bitcoin. </em></p><p>Bitcoin can be cool, or bitcoin can be money, but it cannot be both.</p><h1><strong>Part 2: Bitcoin the Currency</strong></h1><p><em>Make something people want </em>is the unofficial motto of Y Combinator (the unofficial center of the San Francisco startup universe). It\u2019s pretty good advise, not just for startups, but for life.</p><p>Which kind of raises the question: <em>How many people use bitcoin as money?</em></p><p>The answer: not many.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"567\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:567,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xebS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9356470-34fd-403f-80c0-760d6f4ae743_1496x583.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Before we obsess about bitcoin\u2019s capacity, shouldn\u2019t we be asking why no one is using bitcoin as money?</figcaption></figure></div><p>As far as we can tell, bitcoin has found product-market fit as money in just three places:</p><ol><li><p>Facilitating black market transactions</p></li><li><p>Getting money out of places like China and Russia</p></li><li><p>Speculating on the price of bitcoin</p></li></ol><p>Now in these three domains, bitcoin is pretty useful. It isn\u2019t perfect, but it gets the job done\u2026to the tune of about 2 transactions a second.</p><p>Problem for the \u2018bitcoin is money\u2019 theory is that that much activity just isn\u2019t that big of a deal in the broader scheme of things.</p><p>If we use transactions as a proxy for demand for something as currency, it implies there is about <em><strong>50x more demand PayPal money than bitcoin money </strong></em>in transactions, and <em><strong>~1000x more demand for Visa money</strong></em>.</p><p>That\u2019s <em>before </em>you factor in the size of the transactions or the fact that lots of bitcoin transactions are essentially housecleaning, and so total transactions probably a very optimistic measure of demand for bitcoin as money.</p><p>Which just raises another question, one that not enough people are asking: <em>why </em>is (almost) no one using bitcoin as money?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"964\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:964,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fDP4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b4164a8-f3cb-4cbb-a9d1-2f1464dffd9e_2000x1324.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h1><strong>Liquidity</strong></h1><p>Liquidity is another one of those wacky concepts (like money) that\u2019s becomes more and more ephemeral the more you stare at it.</p><p>I like to think of liquidity as inversely related to pain.</p><p>Painful transactions, as measured in time, energy or money, aren\u2019t that liquid.</p><p>Think back to the biggest purchasing decision you ever made, be it a house, a car or even a TV.</p><p>Before buying that asset, you went through a lot of <em><strong>process:</strong></em></p><ul><li><p>Researching what you wanted</p></li><li><p>Understanding the fair price</p></li><li><p>Finding out where it was on sale</p></li><li><p>Negotiating the deal</p></li><li><p>Filling out the paperwork</p></li></ul><p>Let\u2019s say you just bought a house. Were you to turn around immediately and decide to sell the house, you would have to kick off an entirely new process, one that mirrors the one the new buyer would have to engage in.</p><p>This process costs time, energy and money. The more time, energy and money sucked up by transacting in a thing, the less liquid it is.</p><p>This is part of the reason that cars lose 30% of their value when they drive off the lot. It\u2019s not that your car is a fundamentally different object once it is \u2018off the lot,\u2019 it\u2019s just that selling a car is sufficiently painful that most people don\u2019t have the time, energy and money to run a process to get a fair price. That\u2019s why we have car dealerships.</p><p>Ironically, the illiquidity of cars lowers their (resale) prices to the point where the only used cars for sale are the crappy ones that owners are just trying to get rid of. Hence, the \u201c<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Market_for_Lemons\">lemons problem</a>.\u201d</p><p>Anyway, this is all a long way of saying, that when you think about it, when compared to other forms of money, bitcoin is kind of a lemon.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff78c6e84-90fa-4583-8d34-0cc5131f4057_2000x1333.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff78c6e84-90fa-4583-8d34-0cc5131f4057_2000x1333.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff78c6e84-90fa-4583-8d34-0cc5131f4057_2000x1333.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff78c6e84-90fa-4583-8d34-0cc5131f4057_2000x1333.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff78c6e84-90fa-4583-8d34-0cc5131f4057_2000x1333.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lzNI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bb